{"task_id": "HumanEval/47", "solution": "```python\ndef median(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return median of elements in the list l.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_l = sorted(l)\n    n = len(sorted_l)\n\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        median_value = sorted_l[n // 2]\n    else:\n        mid1 = sorted_l[n // 2 - 1]\n        mid2 = sorted_l[n // 2]\n        median_value = (mid1 + mid2) / 2.0\n\n    # Return integer if median is a whole number, otherwise float.\n    if isinstance(median_value, float) and median_value.is_integer():\n        return int(median_value)\n    return median_value\n```"}
