{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "```python\ndef modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p using exponentiation by squaring to handle large inputs efficiently and without numeric overflow.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = 1\n    base = 2\n\n    # Exponentiation by squaring algorithm\n    while n > 0:\n        # If n is odd, multiply base with result\n        if n % 2 == 1:\n            result = (result * base) % p\n\n        # Square the base and take modulo p\n        base = (base * base) % p\n\n        # Halve the exponent\n        n //= 2\n\n    return result\n```"}
